sequenceDiagram
  participant A as agent on the runner
  participant R as relay on the runner
  participant D as agent-driver runner
  participant S as serve, on the Mac
  participant G as GitHub
  A->>R: git push -u origin, after PushGate allowed it
  R->>D: the pre-receive hook bundles the commits
  D->>S: push call, on the control channel
  Note over S: own branch only, unbundle into its clone, value check if a grant is active
  S->>G: git push, your credentials
  G-->>S: accepted or refused
  S-->>D: reply
  D-->>R: hook exits 0 or 1
  R-->>A: GitHub's answer
